# Name of the kind of file the export chooser offers.
snippets-choose-filter-export = 文本片段压缩包

# Title of the export chooser.
snippets-choose-export = 导出文本片段

# Red words when the file chooser would not open.
snippets-chooser-failed = Snippets 无法打开文件选择窗口。

# Said after an export.
snippets-exported = 已导出文本片段。

# Said while an import file is read.
snippets-reading-file = 正在读取文件。

# Said after the replacement was copied.
snippets-copied = 已复制。

# Said when the snippet folder cannot be watched.
snippets-not-watched = 其他程序对文本片段文件所做的更改，Snippets 可能不会自动发现。按“重新加载”即可看到。

# Headline of the ring icon's menu.
snippets-expansion-on = 输入展开已开启

# Headline of the ring icon's menu.
snippets-expansion-off = 输入展开已关闭

# Under the replacement when it cannot expand.
snippets-wont-line-break = 这个文本片段在您输入时不会展开，因为替换文本里有换行或制表符。您仍然可以复制它。

# Under the replacement when it cannot expand.
snippets-wont-variable = 这个文本片段在您输入时不会展开，因为替换文本里有变量。

# Under the replacement when it cannot expand.
snippets-wont-long = 这个文本片段在您输入时不会展开，因为替换文本太长。

# Under the replacement when it cannot expand.
snippets-wont-trigger = 这个文本片段在您输入时不会展开，因为触发词必须是 3 到 32 个字符，且不能有空格。

# Problem when a file cannot be written.
snippets-not-writable = Snippets 无法保存到该文件。

# Problem for a file from a package.
snippets-from-package = 这个来自已安装的软件包，所以在这里是只读的。

# Problem for a file that is a link.
snippets-is-link = 这个文件是指向别处文件的链接，所以不能在这里修改。

# Problem when a snippet is not fully understood.
snippets-no-overwrite = Snippets 无法保存这个文本片段，因为它无法完整显示其内容。

# Problem for a bad new file name.
snippets-file-name-rule = 请使用字母、数字、空格、短横线或下划线。

# Problem for a bad new file name.
snippets-name-unusable = 不能使用这个名称。请换一个。

# Problem for a new file name that exists.
snippets-name-taken = 已经有同名的文件了。

# Problem when an export fails.
snippets-too-many-to-pack = Snippets 无法导出您的文本片段。数量可能太多，一个压缩包装不下。

# Problem when an imported file cannot be named.
snippets-no-free-name = Snippets 找不到可用的名称来保存导入的文件。

# Problem for a file that is too large.
snippets-too-large = 这个文件太大，不能作为文本片段文件。

# Problem for a file that is not UTF-8.
snippets-not-utf8 = 这个文件不是以 UTF-8 文本保存的。

# Problem when a snippet was removed from its file.
snippets-snippet-gone = 该文本片段已不存在。请按“重新加载”。

# Problem when a snippet changed in its file.
snippets-snippet-changed = 自您打开后，该文本片段在文件里已被改动。请按“取消”重新载入。

# Problem when a safe edit was not possible.
snippets-unsafe-change = Snippets 无法在不改动其他文本片段的情况下保存您的更改，所以没有保存任何内容。

# Problem under the triggers box.
snippets-need-trigger = 请至少添加一个触发词。

# Problem under the triggers box.
snippets-trigger-spaces = 触发词不能包含空格。可以试试 :addr 这样的写法。

# Problem under the triggers box.
snippets-trigger-long = 这个触发词太长。

# Problem under the replacement.
snippets-need-replace = 请填写替换文本。

# Problem under the replacement.
snippets-replace-long = 替换文本对文本片段来说太长了。

# Said for a snippet that is shown but not edited.
snippets-odd-shape = 这个文本片段的写法比较特殊，Snippets 无法在这里编辑。

# Said for a snippet that is shown but not edited.
snippets-odd-written = Snippets 可以显示这个文本片段，但无法编辑。

# Said for a snippet that is shown but not edited.
snippets-odd-no-text = 这个文本片段没有纯文本的替换内容。

# Problem for an import file that is too large.
snippets-import-too-large = 该文件太大，不能作为文本片段文件。

# Problem for an import file of the wrong kind.
snippets-import-choose = 请选择 .yml、.yaml 或 .tar.gz 文件。

# Problem for an import that holds no snippets.
snippets-import-none = Snippets 在该文件中没有找到任何文本片段文件。

# Problem for an archive.
snippets-archive-bad = 该压缩包太大或已损坏。

# Problem for an archive.
snippets-archive-unopened = Snippets 无法打开该压缩包。

# Problem for an archive.
snippets-archive-much = 该压缩包里的文件加起来数据量太大。

# Problem for an archive.
snippets-archive-many = 该压缩包里的文件太多。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-anchor = 它用到了锚点、别名或标签。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-flow = 它的各项内容写在同一行。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-flow-list = 它有一个分成多行的列表。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-deep = 它的内容嵌套得太深，Snippets 无法编辑。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-list = 它有一个 Snippets 无法读取的列表。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-after-quote = 结束引号后面还有文字。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-escape = 它含有 Snippets 无法识别的转义代码。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-open-quote = 缺少结束引号。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-colon = 它有一个冒号，YAML 会把它当作名称的开头。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-comment = 它的文字中间夹着注释。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-block-header = Snippets 无法编辑这个块的开头。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-block-indent = Snippets 不支持这个块里的缩进方式。

# Why a file is left alone.
snippets-y-first-indent = 第一行有缩进。Snippets 无法编辑这种格式的文件。

# Why a file is left alone.
snippets-y-not-named = 文本片段文件需要带名称的内容，但这个文件没有。

# Why a file is left alone.
snippets-y-matches-twice = 这个文件里有两个 matches 部分。

# Why a file is left alone.
snippets-y-bom = 这个文件以字节顺序标记开头。Snippets 无法编辑带这种标记的文件。

# Why a file is left alone.
snippets-y-tabs = 这个文件用制表符来缩进文字，而 YAML 不允许这样做。

# Why a file is left alone.
snippets-y-directive = 这个文件以 YAML 指令开头。Snippets 无法编辑带指令的文件。

# Why a file is left alone.
snippets-y-documents = 这个文件包含不止一个文档。

# Why a file is left alone.
snippets-y-one-line = 各个文本片段写在同一行。Snippets 无法编辑这种格式。

# Why a file is left alone.
snippets-y-matches-not-list = matches 项必须是一个列表。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-empty = 它是空的。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-item-indent = Snippets 不支持这些内容的缩进方式。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-item-not-named = 这一项没有带名称的内容。

# Why a snippet is shown but not edited.
snippets-y-item-twice = 这一项里同一个名称出现了两次。

# The count under the search box. $count is how many snippets there are.
snippets-count =
    { $count ->
       *[other] { $count } 个文本片段
    }

# The count under the search box while searching. $shown of $all snippets are found.
snippets-count-found =
    { $all ->
       *[other] 找到 { $shown } 个，共 { $all } 个文本片段
    }

# The version at the foot of the window. $version is its number.
snippets-version = Snippets { $version }

# Red words when the list for typing expansion could not be written. $why says why.
snippets-publish-failed = Snippets 无法更新输入展开：{ $why }

# Under the list for a snippet file that is left alone. $file is its name, $why the reason.
snippets-file-left-alone = Snippets 已跳过 { $file }。{ $why }

# Asks whether to import files that would run commands. $files names them.
snippets-risky = 如果配合 Espanso 使用，{ $files } 会在这台电脑上运行命令。要导入吗？

# A small mark in the list for the other triggers a snippet has. $count is how many more.
snippets-more = 另外还有 { $count } 个

# Said after an import. $count is how many files came in.
snippets-imported =
    { $count ->
       *[other] 已导入 { $count } 个文件。
    }

# Problem when a folder could not be made. $path names it, $why says why.
snippets-dir-failed = Snippets 无法创建 { $path }：{ $why }

# Why a snippet file could not be read. $file is its name, $why the reason.
snippets-file-unreadable = Snippets 无法读取 { $file }。{ $why }

# Problem when nothing was saved because no copy could be kept. $why says why.
snippets-backup-failed = 没有保存任何内容，因为 Snippets 无法为文件做备份：{ $why }

# Problem when a file could not be written. $path names it, $why says why.
snippets-write-failed = Snippets 无法写入 { $path }：{ $why }

# Problem when a file could not be read. $why says why.
snippets-read-failed = Snippets 无法读取文件：{ $why }

# Problem when a file could not be opened. $why says why.
snippets-open-failed = Snippets 无法打开文件：{ $why }

# Problem when a snippet could not be saved. $why says why.
snippets-save-failed = Snippets 无法保存文本片段：{ $why }

# Said for a snippet that is shown but not edited. $names are the values it uses.
snippets-odd-uses = Snippets 可以显示这个文本片段，但无法编辑，因为它用到了 { $names }。

# Problem for a file in an import that is too large. $name is its name.
snippets-import-file-large = { $name } 太大，不能作为文本片段文件导入。

# Why a file is left alone. $line is the line number.
snippets-y-line-indent = 不支持第 { $line } 行的缩进方式。

